, you can hang out with friends in various maps, such as the forest, the beach, and caves! There is also a scary horror mode if you're into that. If your robot looks bland, you can purchase cosmetics in Spencer's Shops. You can also buy a pet robot that follows you around! There are many things to do in the world of Robot Rushers, so have fun!", "short_description": "Welcome to Robot Rushers, in this Social game, you can hang out with friends in various maps. There is also a horror mode! If you think your robot looks bland, you can buy cosmetics. You can also buy a pet robot that follows you around!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1XDnk0nl1gzT1HjI-LlH5Ax78CCXBieuZPOajIm1WgNw/edit", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ZestyVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/zestystudio/home", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["HORROR", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "7930221713673842"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982691_3582597885345637_8377026342206725136_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K_-cGbcWXkcQ7kNvwH27Om0&_nc_oc=AdpoXwLd_k7A6QGYohC7X0ksAtEpBhIE_O9N_tPg1rbAv8BGLxj9ob9ue_44ee0kkd4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn